      "content": "{\"DOCUMENT_METADATA\":{\"applicability_scope\":\"安装机理可用于相同结构泵组;不得扩展为所有泵型的故障事实\",\"doc_id\":\"MP006\",\"document_sha256\":\"A9EEFAD74A30658283F95C36EC477693BA8AB482471290CF12CAE69C95F764F3\",\"page_text_sha256\":\"820c169591f9d0c8908a88c1821dc05fd7dbf6919775d772a9c3c762dcaba08c\",\"pdf_page_number\":7,\"pump_type\":\"centrifugal_pump\",\"scope_note\":\"all explicit pump-system facts in this build page; no target answers\",\"service\":\"pump_installation\",\"source_language\":\"en\",\"source_url\":\"https://www.desmi.com/media/sd5ltlox/guidelines_uk.pdf\",\"target_evidence_roles\":[\"structural_context\",\"symptom\",\"cause_or_mechanism\",\"inspection\",\"maintenance\",\"operating_condition\",\"risk\",\"standard\"],\"target_fault_classes\":[],\"title\":\"Guidelines for Pump Installation\"},\"page_text\":\"                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n      Allowable         vibration       levels     on                             \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n      DESMI       centrifugal         pumps        and    motors                  \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n      As standard DESMI centrifugal pumps with electric motor generate less than 2.8 mm/s vibration velocity (measured\\n      in 3 directions at motor flange level on vertical pumps) during a factory test.\\n                                                                                  \\n      The pump and electric motor industry generally agrees that vibration levels above 7 mm/s are damaging – i.e. this\\n      will result in shorter lifetimes of e.g. bearings and/or shaft seals in pumps (and bearings in motors) than normally\\n      expected. This agrees with the recommendations in the international standard ISO 10816-3.\\n                                                                                  \\n      But in pump installations on ships external excited vibrations from main engine and/or auxiliary machinery are\\n      transferred from ship hull to the pump often resulting in much higher vibration velocities than 7 mm/s.\\n                                                                                  \\n      DESMI recommends the following values for protective settings:              \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n       Location                Vibration alarm level  Vibration trip level        \\n                               (mm/s)                 (mm/s)                      \\n       Pump                    >7                     >10                         \\n       Motor (drive end)       >7                     >10                         \\n       Motor (non drive end)   >10                    >15                         \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n                        ISO 10816-3 Vibration Severity Chart                      \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                                  \\n                          D                                                       \\n                                                          11     0.43             \\n                          C                                                       \\n                                                          7.1    0.28             \\n                                                          4.5    0.18             \\n                          B                                                       \\n                                                          3.5    0.14             \\n                                                          2.8    0.11             \\n                                                          2.3    0.09             \\n                                                          1.4    0.06             \\n                                                                                  \\n                          A                                                       \\n                                                          0.71   0.03             \\n                                                          mm/s rms inch/s rms     \\n      Rigid Flexible Rigid Flexible Rigid Flexible Rigid Flexible Foundation      \\n              pumps > 15 kW     medium sized large machines   Machine type        \\n            radial, axial, mixed flow machines 15kW 300kW <P< 50 MW               \\n                                 <P<300kW                                         \\n       integrated driver external driver motors motors                            \\n                                160 mm < H < 315 315 mm < H                       \\n                                   mm                                             \\n          Group 4     Group 3     Group 2     Group 1           Group             \\n              A   New machine condition      C   Short term operation allowable   \\n              B   Unlimited long-term operation allowable D Vibration causes damage\\n                                                                                  \\n                                                                             7    \\n                                                                                  \",\"tables\":[{\"columns\":[\"Location\",\"Vibration alarm level (mm/s)\",\"Vibration trip level (mm/s)\"],\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00\",\"rows\":[{\"cells\":[{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":314.519,\"top\":292.519,\"x0\":44.502,\"x1\":217.607},\"column\":0,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r000:c00\",\"text\":\"Location\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":314.519,\"top\":292.519,\"x0\":217.607,\"x1\":390.23},\"column\":1,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r000:c01\",\"text\":\"Vibration alarm level\\n(mm/s)\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":314.519,\"top\":292.519,\"x0\":390.23,\"x1\":563.094},\"column\":2,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r000:c02\",\"text\":\"Vibration trip level\\n(mm/s)\"}],\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r000\"},{\"cells\":[{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":328.118,\"top\":314.519,\"x0\":44.502,\"x1\":217.607},\"column\":0,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r001:c00\",\"text\":\"Pump\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":328.118,\"top\":314.519,\"x0\":217.607,\"x1\":390.23},\"column\":1,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r001:c01\",\"text\":\">7\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":328.118,\"top\":314.519,\"x0\":390.23,\"x1\":563.094},\"column\":2,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r001:c02\",\"text\":\">10\"}],\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r001\"},{\"cells\":[{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":341.718,\"top\":328.118,\"x0\":44.502,\"x1\":217.607},\"column\":0,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r002:c00\",\"text\":\"Motor (drive end)\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":341.718,\"top\":328.118,\"x0\":217.607,\"x1\":390.23},\"column\":1,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r002:c01\",\"text\":\">7\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":341.718,\"top\":328.118,\"x0\":390.23,\"x1\":563.094},\"column\":2,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r002:c02\",\"text\":\">10\"}],\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r002\"},{\"cells\":[{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":355.318,\"top\":341.718,\"x0\":44.502,\"x1\":217.607},\"column\":0,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r003:c00\",\"text\":\"Motor (non drive end)\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":355.318,\"top\":341.718,\"x0\":217.607,\"x1\":390.23},\"column\":1,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r003:c01\",\"text\":\">10\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":355.318,\"top\":341.718,\"x0\":390.23,\"x1\":563.094},\"column\":2,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r003:c02\",\"text\":\">15\"}],\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t00:r003\"}]},{\"columns\":[\"ISO 10816-3 Vibration Severity Chart\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01\",\"rows\":[{\"cells\":[{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":420.566,\"top\":401.366,\"x0\":41.319,\"x1\":558.911},\"column\":0,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01:r000:c00\",\"text\":\"ISO 10816-3 Vibration Severity Chart\"}],\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01:r000\"},{\"cells\":[{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":439.766,\"top\":420.566,\"x0\":41.319,\"x1\":85.409},\"column\":0,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01:r001:c00\",\"text\":\"\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":439.766,\"top\":420.566,\"x0\":85.409,\"x1\":129.499},\"column\":1,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01:r001:c01\",\"text\":\"\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":439.766,\"top\":420.566,\"x0\":129.499,\"x1\":173.589},\"column\":2,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01:r001:c02\",\"text\":\"I\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":439.766,\"top\":420.566,\"x0\":173.589,\"x1\":217.607},\"column\":3,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01:r001:c03\",\"text\":\"ISO 108\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":439.766,\"top\":420.566,\"x0\":217.607,\"x1\":261.769},\"column\":4,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01:r001:c04\",\"text\":\"816-3 V\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":439.766,\"top\":420.566,\"x0\":261.769,\"x1\":305.859},\"column\":5,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01:r001:c05\",\"text\":\"Vibrati\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bottom\":439.766,\"top\":420.566,\"x0\":305.859,\"x1\":349.949},\"column\":6,\"id\":\"MP006:p0007:t01:r001:c06\",\"text\":\"ion Sev\"},{\"bbox\":{\"bott